<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Rødøyløva — Selvågos–Rødøyløva return</name><desc>Start at the walking trail beside the Selvågos parking area. Follow the marked trail through the forest, climb the stone stairs onto the eastern ridge, and continue to the summit viewing area. Return by the same trail. The panorama is available away from the unprotected cliff edge.

